---
import M from '../../blog/M.astro';
// Static figure: the multiplication rule of the quaternion units as a cycle i -> j -> k -> i.
---

<figure class="xp qcy">
  <div class="xp-head"><span class="label fig-title">Multiplying the quaternion units</span></div>
  <div class="qcy-row">
    <div class="qcy-canvas" role="img" aria-label="The units i, j and k on a circle with arrows from i to j to k and back to i">
      <svg viewBox="0 0 300 260" aria-hidden="true">
        <defs><marker id="qcy-a" viewBox="0 0 10 10" refX="8" refY="5" markerWidth="8" markerHeight="8" orient="auto-start-reverse"><path d="M0,0 L10,5 L0,10 z" class="qcy-h" /></marker></defs>
        <circle cx="150" cy="135" r="88" class="qcy-c" />
        <path d="M 182 53 A 88 88 0 0 1 236 162" class="qcy-arc" />
        <path d="M 213 200 A 88 88 0 0 1 87 200" class="qcy-arc" />
        <path d="M 64 162 A 88 88 0 0 1 118 53" class="qcy-arc" />
        <circle cx="150" cy="47" r="20" class="qcy-n" /><circle cx="226" cy="179" r="20" class="qcy-n" /><circle cx="74" cy="179" r="20" class="qcy-n" />
      </svg>
      <div class="qcy-l" style="left:50%;top:18%;"><M t="i" /></div>
      <div class="qcy-l" style="left:75.3%;top:68.8%;"><M t="j" /></div>
      <div class="qcy-l" style="left:24.7%;top:68.8%;"><M t="k" /></div>
    </div>
    <div class="qcy-text">
      <p>Along the arrows the product is positive:</p>
      <p class="qcy-eq"><M t={String.raw`i\,j = k, \quad j\,k = i, \quad k\,i = j`} /></p>
      <p>against the arrows it is negative:</p>
      <p class="qcy-eq"><M t={String.raw`j\,i = -k, \quad k\,j = -i, \quad i\,k = -j`} /></p>
      <p>and every unit times itself gives</p>
      <p class="qcy-eq"><M t={String.raw`i^2 = j^2 = k^2 = -1`} /></p>
    </div>
  </div>
  <figcaption><slot /></figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  .qcy .qcy-row { display: grid; grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) minmax(0, 1.2fr); gap: 1.5rem; align-items: center; }
  @media (max-width: 600px) { .qcy .qcy-row { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } }
  .qcy .qcy-canvas { position: relative; width: 100%; aspect-ratio: 300 / 260; container-type: inline-size; }
  .qcy svg { position: absolute; inset: 0; width: 100%; height: 100%; }
  .qcy .qcy-c { fill: none; stroke: var(--border); }
  .qcy .qcy-arc { fill: none; stroke: var(--accent); stroke-width: 2; marker-end: url(#qcy-a); }
  .qcy .qcy-h { fill: var(--accent); }
  .qcy .qcy-n { fill: var(--bg); stroke: var(--fg); stroke-width: 1.5; }
  .qcy .qcy-l { position: absolute; transform: translate(-50%, -50%); font-size: 7cqw; color: var(--fg); }
  .qcy .qcy-text p { margin: 0.2rem 0; text-align: left; }
  .qcy .qcy-eq { color: var(--fg); padding-left: 0.5rem; }
</style>
